[00:00.00] 作词 : Pete Wentz/Patrick Stump/Andy Hurley/Joe Trohman
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Pete Wentz/Patrick Stump/Andy Hurley/Joe Trohman
[00:11.30]Joke me something awful
[00:11.30]用最刻薄的笑话刺伤我
[00:13.80]Just like kisses on the necks of "just friends"
[00:13.80]像"好友"颈间越界的吻痕
[00:18.98]We're the kids who feel like dead ends
[00:18.98]我们是困在死胡同的少年
[00:24.72]And I want to be known for my hits
[00:24.72]我想以高光时刻被铭记
[00:28.90]Not just my misses
[00:28.90]而非屡屡失手
[00:30.89]I took a shot and didn't even come close
[00:30.89]我尝试触碰信任与爱的希望
[00:37.57]At trust and love and hope
[00:37.57]却连边都未能触及
[00:43.50]And the poets are just kids who didn't make it
[00:43.50]诗人不过是失意的孩子
[00:49.86]Who never had it at all
[00:49.86]从未真正拥有过什么
[00:55.85]And the record won't stop skipping
[00:55.85]唱片跳针循环不停
[00:58.79]And the lies just won't stop slipping
[00:58.79]谎言从唇间不断滑落
[01:01.91]And besides my reputation's on the line
[01:01.91]何况我的名声已岌岌可危
[01:07.27]We can fake it for the airwaves
[01:07.27]我们能为电波伪装欢愉
[01:11.45]Force our smiles baby half dead
[01:11.45]强撑笑容半死不活
[01:14.57]From comparing myself to everyone else around me
[01:14.57]因我总在与人比较中耗尽元气
[01:32.48]Please put the doctor on the phone
[01:32.48]请让医生接电话
[01:36.10]Because I'm not making any sense
[01:36.10]因我已语无伦次
[01:39.10]Blame everyone but me for this mess
[01:39.10]这场混乱请责怪全世界除了我
[01:45.77]And my back has been breaking from this heavy heart
[01:45.77]沉重的心事压弯脊梁
[01:51.89]We never seemed so far
[01:51.89]我们从未如此疏远
[01:58.70]I'm hopelessly hopeful
[01:58.70]我绝望地怀抱希望
[02:01.12]You're just hopeless enough
[02:01.12]你恰好足够绝望
[02:03.87]But we never had it at all
[02:03.87]但我们从未真正拥有
[02:10.67]And the record won't stop skipping
[02:10.67]唱片跳针循环不停
[02:13.42]And the lies just won't stop slipping
[02:13.42]谎言从唇间不断滑落
